<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A page with a folded corner and a small padlock.

  Every fill is a system palette colour rather than a fixed paint, so the
  icon takes its colours from the wallpaper like the rest of the app. These
  resources were added to the framework in API 31 and minSdk is 31, so they
  always resolve. On a phone with no wallpaper palette the framework falls
  back to its own default tones, and the icon still reads.
-->
